1
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:45,696
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,068 --> 00:00:48,640
=Episode 24=

3
00:00:54,439 --> 00:00:54,960
My Lord,

4
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,280
restoration is incomplete.

5
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:58,240
You must not scatter your spirit now!

6
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,359
Lizhi.

7
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:10,560
Lizhi!

8
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,079
Come out!

9
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,879
Come out!

10
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,840
I knew something was wrong with you.

11
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:20,040
If you were truly omnipotent,

12
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,079
why would

13
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:22,719
the Emperor guard the Loong Abyss?

14
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,280
What I didn't expect

15
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:28,159
was that you'd watch Wangshu get hurt

16
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:29,599
and still not come out!

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:32,640
Something's off.

18
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:38,120
Let go.

19
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:38,840
No.

20
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,599
If you leave now,

21
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,480
your soul will be shattered!

22
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,519
Let me go!

23
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,640
No!

24
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:45,719
Wangshu,

25
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,760
don't worry. I won't kill you.

26
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,239
I just want to force him out.

27
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:52,079
I know you lied to me.

28
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,879
Your lives are bound together,

29
00:01:55,159 --> 00:01:57,280
and you share every feeling.
When you hurt,

30
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,680
he will surely feel it too.

31
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:05,599
Once he comes out,

32
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:07,319
I'll kill him.

33
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:08,719
That way,

34
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,000
we

35
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:11,919
can

36
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:14,400
be together forever.

37
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,439
Wangshu,

38
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,680
just bear with it.

39
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,000
It'll be over soon.

40
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,479
It'll be over soon.

41
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:25,080
Look at what she's suffering!

42
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,319
Why haven't you come out?

43
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,280
Lizhi!

44
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:30,080
Come out here now!

45
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,319
Wangshu,

46
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,840
even with you like this,

47
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,280
he still won't show up.

48
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,080
In this world,

49
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,000
I'm the one who loves you most.

50
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:44,759
I regret it so much.

51
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,000
I truly regret it.

52
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,680
I should've taken you away
no matter what

53
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,800
and slaughtered everyone

54
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,120
in our way.

55
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:55,800
That way, you never would have met him.

56
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,319
He walks a divine path,

57
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:00,960
while you

58
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:04,240
are merely a speck of dust
along his journey.

59
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,280
You

60
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,840
only have me.

61
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:12,159
He won't come.

62
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:16,960
Because

63
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,360
this is my wish.

64
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,560
Fine.

65
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,479
Fine.

66
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,280
Then we'll die together.

67
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:35,680
I'll send you off first,

68
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,000
and right after,

69
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,319
I'll join you.

70
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,959
Lizhi!

71
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,800
Why did you come back?

72
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:39,480
Why did you come back?

73
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,480
Why did you come back?

74
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,879
What are you doing?

75
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,839
Why did you come back?

76
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:53,519
Lizhi,

77
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,959
why did you come back?

78
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,680
Why did you come back?

79
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:57,639
No!

80
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,439
Stop!

81
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,160
Stop!

82
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:02,519
No!

83
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,759
No!

84
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,240
Stop!

85
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,199
Stop!

86
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,600
No!

87
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,079
No!

88
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:12,920
No!

89
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,720
Stop!

90
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,240
Lizhi.

91
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,360
It can't be.

92
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:39,639
Lizhi.

93
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,439
It can't be.

94
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,120
If the Cloud Steps
can help restore your core,

95
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,199
can't they take you back?

96
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:49,399
It's too late.

97
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,519
Lizhi!

98
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:57,319
Lizhi?

99
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,319
No.

100
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,079
What should I do?

101
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,000
What can I do to save you?

102
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,160
Wangshu,

103
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,519
don't cry.

104
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,759
I am a loong.

105
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:13,040
When I die,

106
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,839
my soul returns to the world.

107
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,079
The wind in the sky will be me,

108
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:20,040
and so will the rain.

109
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,600
And the snow in winter

110
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:25,160
will be me, staying with you
as you grow old.

111
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,759
No.

112
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,199
No.

113
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,839
I only want you, Lizhi.

114
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:33,040
I only want you.

115
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,439
Without you,

116
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:37,240
what does this vast world matter to me?

117
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:38,800
Wangshu,

118
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,639
meeting me was never

119
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,519
what you wanted.

120
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,560
Now,

121
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,399
let everything return
to where it belongs.

122
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:54,304
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

123
00:06:54,304 --> 00:06:56,288
♪Their days ahead are long♪

124
00:06:58,912 --> 00:07:04,519
♪If fate tears us apart♪

125
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,184
No!

126
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:05,839
No!

127
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,600
No!

128
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,439
No!

129
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:09,879
Lizhi!

130
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,000
Lizhi!

131
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,920
Lizhi!

132
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:20,279
Lizhi!

133
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:25,680
Lizhi!

134
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:28,672
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

135
00:07:28,672 --> 00:07:31,744
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

136
00:07:32,256 --> 00:07:34,688
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

137
00:07:35,104 --> 00:07:37,568
♪With you here♪

138
00:07:37,568 --> 00:07:40,672
♪Everywhere is my home♪

139
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,439
My Lord, I will help you.

140
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:11,232
♪Then they travel
to every corner of the world♪

141
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:16,000
♪She takes up her brush
to paint his likeness♪

142
00:08:19,552 --> 00:08:24,544
♪Passersby ask
why she pauses to look back♪

143
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,480
My Lord!

144
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:33,519
(That day,)

145
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,000
(in the Loong Abyss,)

146
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:36,759
(it was my blood)

147
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,960
(that broke his thousand-year seal,)

148
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,679
(binding our senses as one.)

149
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:43,120
(Perhaps...)

150
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:52,720
What are you doing?

151
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:56,360
Since my blood
could contain his Li Fire,

152
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,039
then

153
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:00,799
could it

154
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:01,919
bring him back as well?

155
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,799
I beg you,

156
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:07,480
come back!

157
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,559
It's not enough.

158
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:13,919
Ordinary blood isn't enough.

159
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:18,080
What about my heart's blood?

160
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,360
Lizhi,

161
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,559
I believe

162
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,440
you will protect me forever.

163
00:09:28,919 --> 00:09:29,720
I believe

164
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:33,799
you'll come back.

165
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,120
You'll die!

166
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:41,760
♪Letting you cast the dream into flames
to end it all♪

167
00:09:41,856 --> 00:09:46,112
♪Burn away the snow in my memory♪

168
00:09:46,112 --> 00:09:48,576
♪That cruel deceit♪

169
00:09:48,576 --> 00:09:53,152
♪Let me crave one last time♪

170
00:09:53,248 --> 00:09:55,424
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

171
00:09:55,668 --> 00:09:58,624
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

172
00:09:58,784 --> 00:10:02,592
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

173
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:09,039
The hour has come!

174
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:10,799
(Prisoner)
Execute them!

175
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:11,744
(Behead)

176
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,360
(Later on,)

177
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,519
(Jiang Liuying and Prince Qi)

178
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,159
(were executed for high treason,)

179
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:20,320
(and Prince Qi's loyalists
were wiped out.)

180
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,399
(With her outstanding talent,)

181
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,240
(Xingyao rose rapidly in court,)

182
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,919
(eventually becoming Empress.)

183
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:32,039
(Now, she and His Majesty)

184
00:10:32,039 --> 00:10:34,360
(are revered by the people
as the Two Sovereigns.)

185
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,080
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

186
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,000
- Long live the Empress!
- Long live the Empress!

187
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:44,840
- Long live the Two Sovereigns!
- Long live the Two Sovereigns!

188
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,240
(As for Lizhi and me?)

189
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:50,679
(He returned)

190
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,840
(to his original form.)

191
00:10:56,759 --> 00:10:57,879
My Lord,

192
00:10:58,399 --> 00:11:00,559
you look pretty disheveled like this.

193
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,840
(Lanyuan said)

194
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,120
(Lizhi's soul)

195
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,240
(needs the world's
spiritual energy to reform,)

196
00:11:08,759 --> 00:11:10,279
(though the time needed is unknown.)

197
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,039
(So)

198
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,480
(I took Lizhi with me,)

199
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:15,879
(traveling through Daizhou
and past the North,)

200
00:11:16,399 --> 00:11:18,039
(measuring the land with my own steps,)

201
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:21,360
(and recording its customs in writing.)

202
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:27,399
(It's alright,)

203
00:11:27,559 --> 00:11:28,120
(Lizhi.)

204
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,480
(As long as you return,)

205
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,000
(I will wait,)

206
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,080
(no matter how long.)

207
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,200
(Wandering Sage Yue Wangshu)
Step right up! Don't miss out!

208
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:49,519
(The Cloud and Water Records)
Wandering Sage Yue Wangshu's new book!

209
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,720
Wandering Sage wrote

210
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,200
the Cloud and Water Records,

211
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:54,799
and it was officially recorded
in the Imperial Archives!

212
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:56,039
Hurry up and grab your copy!

213
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,200
Step right up!

214
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,200
Don't miss out!

215
00:11:58,759 --> 00:11:59,600
What's more,

216
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:01,840
this book is exclusive
to our Jianning Bookshop!

217
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,960
Impressive, aren't I?

218
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,480
Listen to that.

219
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:09,759
How have you been, Wangshu?

220
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:11,519
You're busy
with state affairs every day.

221
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,759
Why are you traveling in disguise?

222
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:14,919
Aren't you scared to be seen?

223
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:16,519
I need to get some fresh air.

224
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,320
Besides,

225
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:19,440
staying in the palace day and night,

226
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,000
how can I truly know our people?

227
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:24,960
You often record the landscapes
and the lives of the people.

228
00:12:25,679 --> 00:12:27,519
Those insights have helped us immensely.

229
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,279
Traveling the realm

230
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:31,000
was always my lifelong dream.

231
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,559
As a child, I never imagined

232
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,879
that one day,

233
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:41,000
I would chart those rivers and mountains
with my own hands.

234
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:42,720
Besides,

235
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:44,519
I'm traveling with him.

236
00:12:50,464 --> 00:12:51,232
Come take a look!

237
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,320
Hang it higher!

238
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:58,560
Let's go.

239
00:12:59,639 --> 00:13:01,320
Come carve your names!

240
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,600
Come take a look!

241
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,360
Ensures a happy marriage!

242
00:13:10,759 --> 00:13:12,200
Carve your names!

243
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,440
It's snowing.

244
00:13:29,716 --> 00:13:30,272
(Lizhi)

245
00:13:52,563 --> 00:13:53,088
(Wangshu)

246
00:14:49,428 --> 00:14:54,003
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

247
00:14:54,778 --> 00:14:59,275
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

248
00:15:02,514 --> 00:15:07,636
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

249
00:15:07,636 --> 00:15:10,975
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

250
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,240
I'm back.

251
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:20,617
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

252
00:15:21,168 --> 00:15:22,958
♪He cannot learn them♪

253
00:15:22,958 --> 00:15:26,093
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

254
00:15:29,245 --> 00:15:31,569
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

255
00:15:31,569 --> 00:15:33,932
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

256
00:15:34,510 --> 00:15:37,174
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

257
00:15:37,174 --> 00:15:38,932
♪Their days ahead are long♪

258
00:15:41,652 --> 00:15:47,603
♪If fate tears us apart♪

259
00:15:48,107 --> 00:15:53,826
♪I will gamble against heaven itself♪

260
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:57,642
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

261
00:15:57,642 --> 00:16:01,159
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

262
00:16:01,178 --> 00:16:04,313
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

263
00:16:04,313 --> 00:16:08,064
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

264
00:16:08,064 --> 00:16:11,538
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

265
00:16:11,538 --> 00:16:14,799
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

266
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:17,555
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

267
00:16:17,555 --> 00:16:20,576
♪With you here♪

268
00:16:20,576 --> 00:16:23,456
♪Everywhere is my home♪

269
00:16:49,312 --> 00:16:54,080
♪Then they travel
to every corner of the world♪

270
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:59,584
♪She takes up her brush
to paint his likeness♪

271
00:17:02,368 --> 00:17:07,296
♪Passersby ask
why she pauses to look back♪

272
00:17:07,936 --> 00:17:13,472
♪She says a loong's roar
echoes in the wind♪

273
00:17:16,140 --> 00:17:18,547
♪Ten years later,
the street carver opens shop again♪

274
00:17:18,547 --> 00:17:20,227
♪Those two wooden plaques
hang once more♪

275
00:17:20,227 --> 00:17:21,826
♪Someone ties a red string from behind♪

276
00:17:21,826 --> 00:17:23,648
♪Snow falls on shoulders,
growing old together♪

277
00:17:23,648 --> 00:17:25,389
♪The loong's song
leaves a legend in this realm♪

278
00:17:25,389 --> 00:17:27,030
♪Land and rivers as gifts,
wind and snow as adornment♪

279
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,288
♪This time, no sacrifice,
no turning back♪

280
00:17:28,288 --> 00:17:30,201
♪Only with you,
I watch moonset and rising tides♪

281
00:17:30,201 --> 00:17:36,152
♪If fate tears us apart♪

282
